title: "btc-brute-force: Bitcoin Address-Collision Research Toolkit"
abstract: "An offline Go research toolkit for studying Bitcoin P2PKH address generation, Hash160 lookup, secp256k1 performance, and why broad Bitcoin brute-force address-collision search is computationally infeasible."
